                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">QUITTING TIPS</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">How to Survive the First Week:</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <list listType="ordered">
                     <item>
                        <caption>1.</caption>
                        <content styleCode="bold">Control your physical cravings for nicotine.</content>
                     </item>
                     <item>
                        <caption> </caption>Use enough - You can greatly increase your chances for success by using at least 9 mini lozenges per day during the first 6 weeks when you start using mini Nicotine Polacrilex Lozenges.</item>
                     <item>
                        <caption>2.</caption>
                        <content styleCode="bold">Get rid of all signs that you ever smoked –</content>
                     </item>
                     <item>
                        <caption> </caption>ashtrays, matches and, of course, cigarettes.</item>
                     <item>
                        <caption>3.</caption>
                        <content styleCode="bold">Stay active.</content>
                     </item>
                     <item>
                        <caption> </caption>Keep busy to take your mind off smoking.</item>
                     <item>
                        <caption>4.</caption>
                        <content styleCode="bold">Think positive!</content>
                     </item>
                     <item>
                        <caption> </caption>The first week is the toughest. Remind yourself that it will get easier.</item>
                  </list>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">TIPS</content>
                  </paragraph>
                  <list listType="unordered">
                     <item>
                        <caption>•</caption>Make sure you tell friends and family members that you quit.</item>
                     <item>
                        <caption>•</caption>Use enough mini Nicotine Polacrilex Lozenges – at least 9 mini lozenges per day during the first 6 weeks.</item>
                     <item>
                        <caption>•</caption>Stay active. Keep busy to take your mind off smoking.</item>
                     <item>
                        <caption>•</caption>When an urge to smoke strikes, take a few deep breaths and remind yourself how important quitting is to you.</item>
                  </list>
